@startuml pop_up_manager
package popup {
  class PopupManager {
    - pool: Deque<Popup>
    - active: List<Popup>
    - poolSize: int
    + PopupManager(poolSize: int)
    + pop(text: String, screenX: int, screenY: int, variant: PopupVariant, lifeFrames: int): void
    + popItem(item: entity.Entity, screenX: int, screenY: int, variant: PopupVariant, lifeFrames: int): void
    + updateAll(): void
    + drawAll(g2: java.awt.Graphics2D): void
  }

  class Popup {
    + text: String
    + icon: java.awt.Image
    + screenX: int
    + screenY: int
    + vy: float
    + life: int
    + maxLife: int
    + alpha: float
    + variant: PopupVariant
    + init(text: String, icon: Image, sx: int, sy: int, variant: PopupVariant, lifeFrames: int): void
    + update(): void
    + isAlive(): boolean
  }

  enum PopupVariant {
    PLAYER_DAMAGE
    MONSTER_DAMAGE
    GUARDED_DAMAGE
    HEAL
    XP
    DROP
    INFO
  }
}

package entity {
  class Entity {
    + getName(): String
    + getImage(): java.awt.Image
  }
}

package frame {
  class FrameApp {
    + getTileSize(): int
  }
}

PopupManager --> Popup : manages
PopupManager ..> PopupVariant : uses
PopupManager ..> entity.Entity : reads
PopupManager ..> java.awt.Graphics2D : draws
Popup ..> PopupVariant : has
Popup ..> java.awt.Image : has
PopupManager ..> FrameApp : uses (static)

note right of PopupManager
**Notes**
Purpose
- ポップアップのオブジェクトプール管理とライフサイクル制御を行う。
- アクティブなポップアップの更新と描画を一元化する。

- Manage an object pool for popups and control their lifecycle.
- Centralize updating and rendering of active popups.
end note

note left of PopupManager
**Notes**
Responsibilities
- メソッドは synchronized でスレッド安全を確保しているが、描画は EDT で行うこと。
- プールサイズを超える場合は新規生成する設計。必要なら上限や破棄ポリシーを検討する。
- 大量のポップアップ発生時はオブジェクトプールのサイズ調整で GC を抑える。

- Methods are synchronized to ensure thread safety, but rendering must run on the Swing Event Dispatch Thread (EDT).
- When the pool is exhausted, new Popup instances are created; consider adding an upper bound or eviction policy if needed.
- Tune the pool size to reduce GC pressure when many popups are generated simultaneously.
end note

note right of Popup
**Notes**
Display logic
- alpha を使ってフェードアウト、vy で上方向移動、life で寿命管理。
- icon がある場合はアイコン描画（DROP など）とテキスト描画を組み合わせる。

- Use alpha for fade-out, vy for upward movement, and life for lifetime management.
- When an icon is present (e.g., DROP variant), draw the icon and combine it with text rendering.
end note

@enduml